{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"[color=#FF0000][b]Đây là những tài liệu VIP, chúng tôi đã kỳ công biên tập (hoặc mua .CBL bên Trung Quốc với giá không hề thấp).\r\nChúng tôi bán lại file với một mức chi phí hợp lý để duy trì hoạt động của Web Cờ Tướng.\r\nRất mong mọi người không đăng tải công khai những tài liệu này lên mạng xã hội.\r\nNếu bạn cần mua những tài liệu VIP khác, vui lòng liên hệ\r\nhttps://m.me/tieututhichco hoặc số điện thoại: 093.365.8383\r\nCảm ơn sự ủng hộ của các bạn![/b][/color]\r\n\r\n\r\n","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0a2","comment":"前6个回合为中炮过河车对屏风马平炮兑车的基本阵势。值得提出的是，黑方第6回合也有走士4进5之后再炮9退1，其用意是双方对布局发展的选择就会略受限制。现在红方左马屯边是老杨布局手册中的常用套路，另一拿手着法为马八进七之后发展成五九炮的阵势。两种套路交替使用战果良好。除此两种着法外，还有兵五进一或炮八平七也各有复杂变化。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"另一路常用的变化为马3退5之后是炮八进四，炮2平5，马九进七，炮9平7，车三平四，马5进3，车九进一，卒7进1，车九平四，卒7平6，兵三进一，车8平7，马三进四，马7进8，演变下去双方可取得大体的均势。现在黑方选走士4进5其作战意图是撑住右翼而于左翼展开反击。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b3","comment":"不如走车八进六较为积极，黑方如走马7进8，车四退四，又如象3进5，兵七进一红有攻势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7g7","comment":"由于红方第13回合走车八进三过于稳健，黑方抓住战机，先平炮兑车，亮出车路，再兑马赶车亮出炮口进击红马，局势豁然开朗。第15回合黑炮轰马邀兑，迫使左炮右移，第16回合一个回马枪吃车迫使红方以炮换马，黑右炮得以顺利转移到左翼有力阵地。黑方这几个回合运子巧妙，对于后走一方来说，能取得这一形势可称满意了。黑方中路略显薄弱，但红方两翼亦较弱，双方得以抵偿，局势大致均等。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2c3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b0","comment":"从上面三个回合来看，双方对自己的形势都很乐观，斗志旺盛都主动地挑起了战火.第19回合红如车四退一则局势就会趋于平淡；又如第20回合黑走车2进6则战斗也不会过于激烈。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7d9","comment":"？\r\n软着，回马旨在左炮右移，配合右底车强攻。但对局证明这一计划难以实现，反而丧失战机，造成黑马受制少兵的被动局面。应改走炮6平7，这一看似平淡之着，下伏不少进击手段。首先有炮7进4之凶着，另有车7平9再炮7平4等左右闪击之变化，将给对方提出在防守上以较难之课题。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f7a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a3a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h3f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"ne